<title>POLAND: Wedel sees 1997 net soaring to PLN 50 mln.</title>
<headline>Wedel sees 1997 net soaring to PLN 50 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish confectioner Wedel SA sees its net profit surging to 50.5 million zlotys next year, up from 27.6 million forecasted for 1996, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said its sales should grow to 915.4 million zlotys in 1997, up from 660 million zlotys expected this year.</p>
<p>It expected its investments to amount to 75.6 million zlotys next year.</p>
<p>Last year Wedel showed a net profit of 26.6 million zlotys on 462-million-zloty sales.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
